; nodes now form the combined fmuladd node with their fadd users, so the
; scalar rows are priced as fmadd chains and the tree, whose coefficients are
; gathered from the arguments, is not profitable. Previously the constant lane
; blocked the combine, the scalar rows were priced as separate fmul and fadd
; and the tree was vectorized 4-wide.
